--   Dual currency (robuxPrice + dualCurrency): tetap PurchaseLot (Candy Corn/Sheckles)
--   Robux-only (robuxPrice tanpa dualCurrency): di-skip (bukan auto Robux)
-- Catatan: RequestSnapshot:Fire() sering return nil meski auction live; Snapshot
--   push sering baru saat next roll. Fallback: steal lot array dari
--   AuctioneerController via getgc (rawget only — skip Instance/Connection).
-- UI Auction hanya tampilan — TIDAK wajib untuk auto buy.

